    <paragraph>Use the Midpoint Formula</paragraph>
    <paragraph>In the following exercises, ⓐ find the midpoint of the line segment whose endpoints are given and ⓑ plot the endpoints and the midpoint on a rectangular coordinate system.</paragraph>
